#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:5 2421b54f70974ebca4b1aa98e736979c
#: 4fe0bea590254e7a87b8e1405dddfb31 ab893d6512e64797a382eeb02e0bf5c4
#: b9562cf276c2403997202dce4cde9144 d5a88324915248fa983473f3ffd2f7c8
msgid "GPS for Yaw (aka Moving Baseline)"
msgstr "GPS 偏航（又称动态基线）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:7 146e8a5efff64abcbe5d56ad88b31192
#: ae26b70aa08b4cc28efe023cc3461a92 b02d7d8a345b42059ae08dd20881528f
#: daf8c58615134a0f9bc35c7125a5befa e78ea4b303d44fa9a3749ddb689b0880
msgid ""
"New RTK GPS modules, such as a pair of Ublox F9's, devices based on the "
"Unicore UM-982 or some dual-antenna devices can be used to estimate yaw, in "
"addition to providing position information. This removes the need for a "
"compass which may suffer from magnetic interference from the ground or the "
"vehicle's motors and ESCs. This works even if the GPSs do not have an RTK "
"fix (RTCM data from a fixed RTK station or NTRIP server)."
msgstr ""
"新型 RTK GPS 模块，如一对 Ublox F9 或基于 Unicore UM-982 "
"的设备或某些双天线设备，除提供位置信息外，还可用于估计偏航角。这消除了对罗盘的需求，而罗盘可能受到地面或飞行器电机和 ESC 的磁干扰。即使 GPS "
"没有 RTK 定位（来自固定 RTK 站或 NTRIP 服务器的 RTCM 数据），这也能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:12
