#: 9c2397414cc4415e89a64feaa7e5c1d1
msgid ""
"GPSes from ArduPilot Partners that are known to work are shown on the "
":ref:`common-positioning-landing-page`"
msgstr "已知可用的 ArduPilot 合作伙伴 GPS 显示在 :ref:`common-positioning-landing-page`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:16
#: 19ac7da8d6444398bb1ae9fba86b6b8c 6b9ff4b02bfe45d8ba4de756bb09fdcd
#: 9afca620044b4091af167da2a206f1b9 b65f1d57371b4868b1064ae56f213577
#: f7963e3cb7124089b201bf812ed37324
msgid ""
"**Ublox F9P modules must run firmware version 1.3.2 or higher and "
"constellations configured**. See :ref:`common-gps-ublox-firmware-update`."
msgstr ""
"**Ublox F9P 模块必须运行固件版本 1.3.2 或更高版本并配置星座**。见 :ref:`common-gps-ublox-firmware-"
"update`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:20
#: 359e8f0aaa554781b5848364b9472a1d 603d908703164f30b5a3de3072aa55ef
#: 6ab9dea9685a46e48a948d26d4e4d70d 7dd715e0da104e50ac83e7a957416961
#: 8d7c5d9e760048d5a00cc7ec52f6a89b
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr "硬件设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:22
#: 01459ea6801b432a9bf881758ca697d3 100094d4bbd14ee8a3fba61743c28900
#: 7af20bc8d950409f8ddbeb45405f8404 b462eaf48867448ab2b898d00428f672
#: e3eb56cf2c1244c2b641bd34c007eced
msgid ""
"GPS Yaw estimation relies on the detection of signal delays from each "
"satellite as they reach two separated antennas. The GPS system may consist "
"of dual or a single module, but two antennas are required in each case."
msgstr "GPS 偏航估计依赖于检测每颗卫星信号到达两个分离天线的延迟。GPS 系统可以由双模块或单模块组成，但每种情况下都需要两根天线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:24
#: 08cb504da15f4ca0a43daab7d896f300 094d54fe46c44b5c87c1e9529f67a374
#: 0b189265445d46fa9ee1abc600e08e49 27d77c849b8f48cd974f916f4beab38c
#: e98695209a164d8cb8cfb6a6f345fcc5
msgid "The antennas must be separated by at least 30cm on the vehicle."
msgstr "天线在飞行器上的间距必须至少为 30cm。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:25
#: 0d36b768f3d6490d8e3684a53eed2383 6fda08795a3d4692962687efef3d0ae3
#: 9e502294b89f4c48956b48d5e487d2cb d4e5c83b473c4fa4af03b6541bd79f58
#: d769db1fed2840b7b9327eb89a5c7ad8
msgid ""
"For dual unit systems, the 1st GPS and 2nd GPS should be connected to the "
"serial/telem ports on the autopilot or via DroneCAN.  The following "
"parameter instructions assume Serial3 and Serial4 are used for serial "
"connecting GPSes but any serial port(s) should work as long as the first "
"port using protocol 5 is connected to one of the GPS."
msgstr ""
"对于双单元系统，第 1 个 GPS 和第 2 个 GPS 应通过飞控上的串口/数传端口或 DroneCAN 连接。以下参数说明假设 Serial3 和 "
"Serial4 用于串行连接 GPS，但只要第一个使用协议 5 的端口连接到一个 GPS，任何串口均应可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:27
#: 87d6421a380449aab60897d36385e11e bbe2ff95e00f4acd83acdf38ca87d81e
#: d442e1e3b01e40e78a83f2309174c6df dc7ffe9e28bc456ab05a5895d3e6dfd5
#: dff34ae74bb843b89222c3fd589c800a
msgid ""
"Dual unit Serial GPS modules must be connected to ArduPilot via their (not "
"the autopilots's) UART1 connectors, DroneCAN modules via CAN , or "
"interconnected per their manufacturer instructions."
msgstr ""
"双单元串行 GPS 模块必须通过其（而非飞控的）UART1 连接器连接到 ArduPilot，DroneCAN 模块通过 CAN "
"连接，或按照制造商说明互连。"

