msgid ""
"If DroneCAN GPS are used, then configure the CAN/DroneCAN ports as explained"
" in :ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` and instead of setting up the SERIAL"
" port protocols above, make sure that no SERIAL ports are setup with GPS "
"protocol (\"5\"). Also be sure that the two DroneCAN GPS are on the same "
"physical CAN bus from the autopilot. This usually requires that a CAN bus "
"splitter be used. Then set these parameters:"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 DroneCAN GPS，则按 :ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` 中说明配置 CAN/DroneCAN "
"端口，而不是设置上述串口协议，确保没有串口设置为 GPS 协议（「5」）。还要确保两个 DroneCAN GPS 在飞控的同一物理 CAN "
"总线上，这通常需要使用 CAN 总线分路器。然后设置以下参数："

