"In a location with good GPS reception point the vehicle at a landmark some "
"distance away and then check the heading on the ground station matches.  "
"Rotate the vehicle and ensure the heading on the ground station updates "
"correctly."
msgstr "在 GPS 信号良好的地点，将机体对准远处的地标，然后检查地面站上显示的航向是否一致。旋转机体，确认地面站上的航向也随之正确更新。"

