#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:67
#: 0cb628553e214882ae39d5f10d1708b0 0fb05604b39c424ca97f63ddb9e7e598
#: 168b270b8eb245b4996d670a2a84d154 d19603eff4cd42ed86f502a615d31c10
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS1_CAN_OVRIDE<GPS1_CAN_OVRIDE>` (Base NODEID) and "
":ref:`GPS2_CAN_OVRIDE<GPS2_CAN_OVRIDE>` (Rover NODEID) determine which "
"physical DroneCAN GPS is used for GPS1 and GPS2. These are automatically "
"populated at boot from the detected addresses, which are also shown in "
":ref:`GPS1_CAN_NODEID<GPS1_CAN_NODEID>` and "
":ref:`GPS2_CAN_NODEID<GPS2_CAN_NODEID>`, but can be overridden, if needed. "
"You will need to determine which physical CAN GPS is assigned as GPS1 and "
"GPS2 in order to setup the position offsets (see :ref:`Sensor Position "
"Offset are here <common-sensor-offset-compensation>`)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`GPS1_CAN_OVRIDE<GPS1_CAN_OVRIDE>` （Base NODEID）和 "
":ref:`GPS2_CAN_OVRIDE<GPS2_CAN_OVRIDE>` （Rover NODEID）决定哪个物理 DroneCAN GPS 用作"
" GPS1 和 GPS2。它们在启动时会根据检测到的地址自动填充，这些地址也会显示在 "
":ref:`GPS1_CAN_NODEID<GPS1_CAN_NODEID>` 和 "
":ref:`GPS2_CAN_NODEID<GPS2_CAN_NODEID>` 中，但如有需要可以手动覆盖。你需要确定哪个物理 CAN GPS 被指定为"
" GPS1 和 GPS2，才能设置位置偏移（见 :ref:`传感器位置偏移 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:98
#: 5453e7eb2e7e4a279d4e7052984585d1 625c92f595ff474f9874ad31b14a7adc
#: d3c3d0515b724332ae8e107f352b2c60 fa42f37abb9e4993a3b721946fdd374d
msgid ""
"these units can be used with only its \"Master\" antenna connected, if "
"desired, but no yaw information should be used. In this case set "
":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 24 (UnicoreMaster)"
msgstr ""
"如有需要，这些模块可以只连接其 \"Master\" 天线使用，但此时不应使用任何航向（yaw）信息。这种情况下请设置 "
":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 24（UnicoreMaster）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:136
#: 1abbfc5d137a44188b049d5c1ff75f70 8968f3e72fc1426dba956c01a35a8a70
#: a3c9bed44329452a8cd58138d76189ff c648e6b7c87c4004b3fdd9d94cdd53dd
msgid ""
"ArduPilot will automatically forward RTCM correction data it receives over "
"MAVLink from a GCS or telemetry radio (from a fixed baseline RTK base "
"station) to these GPSes. See :ref:`common-rtk-correction`."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 会自动将其通过 MAVLink 从 GCS 或数传电台接收到的 RTCM 改正数据（来自固定基线的 RTK 基站）转发给这些 "
"GPS。见 :ref:`common-rtk-correction`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-for-yaw.rst:145
#: 1eaa2c693b00497996ee3fd446547050 23ee7683b97e4460804ed05f733e04c6
#: bef735e3a8b046c5a062e59684a4869d d941f6b1947145f28025bf5e7fe02e59
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS1_POS_Z<GPS1_POS_Z>`: offset in meters from the Center of Gravity "
"to \"Master\" antenna in the Z axis (in direction up and down, positive "
"offsets are if \"Master\" below the Center of Gravity."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GPS1_POS_Z<GPS1_POS_Z>`：\"Master\" 天线相对重心在 Z "
"轴（上下方向）的偏移量，单位为米；\"Master\" 天线位于重心下方时偏移为正。"
